{"id":"1d80ae40ec0a66ef","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/596_道义逻辑_Standard_Deontic_Logic_SDL.md","title":"596 道义逻辑 Standard Deontic Logic SDL","display":"596_道义逻辑_Standard_Deontic_Logic_SDL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\">\\(OA\\)</span>。许可缩写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA:=\\neg O\\neg A\">\\(PA:=\\neg O\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本文件的命题原子直接取命题名本身；原子记号固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p\\)</span>。因此形成、自由符号、替换和满足子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\)</span> 是同一个公式对象。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(OA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(OA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{596}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{596}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,596}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,596}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\\)</span>，替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(OA,\\sigma)=O\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(OA,\\sigma)=O\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{596}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{596}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{596}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{596}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{596}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{596}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{596}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{596}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>道义公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{596}=\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{596}=\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}=\\{OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}=\\{OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{596}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{596}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{OA}\\ (Nec_O).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{OA}\\ (Nec_O).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{596}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{596}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{596}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{596}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\)</span>，并且每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{596}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{596}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{596}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{596}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{596}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{596}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{596}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{596}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{596}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{596}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{596}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{596}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{596}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{596}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-道义一致性证书\">8. 道义一致性证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"596\">\\(596\\)</span>-一致性证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{596}\n=\\{(A,OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{596}\n=\\{(A,OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证书的第二分量恰属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{596}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目是只含一元义务算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的标准道义系统；许可 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 不是原始构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SDL}_{596}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{596},\\mathsf{Frm}_{596},\\operatorname{PV}_{596},\\operatorname{BV}_{596},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,596},\\mathsf{Subst}_{596},\\operatorname{Sub}_{596},\\mathsf{Ax}_{596},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596},\\mathsf{Rule}_{596},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{596},\\operatorname{last}_{596},\\vdash_{596},\\mathsf{Thm}_{596},\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{596}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SDL}_{596}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{596},\\mathsf{Frm}_{596},\\operatorname{PV}_{596},\\operatorname{BV}_{596},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,596},\\mathsf{Subst}_{596},\\operatorname{Sub}_{596},\\mathsf{Ax}_{596},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{596},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{596},\\mathsf{Rule}_{596},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{596},\\operatorname{last}_{596},\\vdash_{596},\\mathsf{Thm}_{596},\\mathsf{Cert}_{D}^{596}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含标准道义逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含可能世界语义或规范冲突理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-道义一致性证书","text":"8. 道义一致性证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{obl}","display":false},{"tex":"OA","display":false},{"tex":"PA:=\\neg O\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p):=p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(OA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{596}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{596}(A)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\alpha,596}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{596}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{596}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{596})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{596}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{596}\\times\